content in rendered editions - is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).

The complete license text is in LICENSE-CONTENT. The canonical license URI is:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Suggested attribution for the project as a whole:

    "ESQC Mathematics Exercises" by Simen Kvaal and contributors,
    licensed under CC BY 4.0.

The contributors and their requested attribution details are recorded in
CONTRIBUTORS.md and the Git history.

When sharing an adaptation, identify the creator, provide the license link,
link to the source where reasonably practicable, and indicate that changes
were made.

2. Software and build files

Original software, scripts, stylesheets, configuration, and build tooling
authored for this repository are licensed under the MIT License in
